{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-sampling","title":"成本优化与采样策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/cost-optimization-sampling","wordCount":1349,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本优化与采样策略\">成本优化与采样策略</h1><p>日志系统的成本增长通常超出线性——服务数量翻倍，日志量可能翻四倍（更多跨服务调用、更多中间件日志）。当月账单从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>增长到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5K 增长到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增长到</span></span></span></span></span>50K 时，&quot;全量保留所有日志&quot;不再是可持续的策略。成本优化不是&quot;少记日志&quot;这么粗暴，而是在保持排障能力和合规义务的前提下，系统性地减少无效存储和处理开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志系统成本由采集、存储、索引、查询四部分组成，总成本正比于日志量乘以保留天数。采样策略分四种：Head-based（入口概率采样）、Tail-based（保留所有异常请求）、Priority-based（按级别优先级）、Dynamic（运行时自适应）。非采样降本手段包括列式压缩（ZSTD 10-20x）、字段裁剪、聚合替代明细。成本治理需要可见性（按 service 归因）和限流（per-tenant quota + 自动降级）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日志系统成本模型\">日志系统成本模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    COST[总成本] --&gt; INGEST[采集成本]&#10;    COST --&gt; STORE[存储成本]&#10;    COST --&gt; QUERY[查询成本]&#10;    COST --&gt; TRANSFER[传输成本]&#10;    INGEST --&gt; I1[Agent CPU/Memory]&#10;    INGEST --&gt; I2[Collector 处理资源]&#10;    STORE --&gt; S1[热存储 - SSD]&#10;    STORE --&gt; S2[温/冷存储 - 对象存储]&#10;    STORE --&gt; S3[索引存储]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; Q1[计算资源]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; Q2[按查询计费 - SaaS]&#10;    TRANSFER --&gt; T1[跨 AZ/Region 流量]\">graph TD\n    COST[总成本] --&gt; INGEST[采集成本]\n    COST --&gt; STORE[存储成本]\n    COST --&gt; QUERY[查询成本]\n    COST --&gt; TRANSFER[传输成本]\n    INGEST --&gt; I1[Agent CPU/Memory]\n    INGEST --&gt; I2[Collector 处理资源]\n    STORE --&gt; S1[热存储 - SSD]\n    STORE --&gt; S2[温/冷存储 - 对象存储]\n    STORE --&gt; S3[索引存储]\n    QUERY --&gt; Q1[计算资源]\n    QUERY --&gt; Q2[按查询计费 - SaaS]\n    TRANSFER --&gt; T1[跨 AZ/Region 流量]</pre><p>日志系统的成本公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{total} = C_{ingest} \\cdot V + C_{store} \\cdot V \\cdot R + C_{index} \\cdot V \\cdot F + C_{query} \\cdot Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> = 日志量（GB/天）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> = 保留天数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> = 索引字段比例（全文索引 vs 仅 label）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> = 查询频率</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本组成</th>\n<th align=\"center\">ELK 占比</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Loki 占比</th>\n<th align=\"center\">ClickHouse 占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储（含索引）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">50-60%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">30-40%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">35-45%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算（采集+查询）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">30-40%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">40-50%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">40-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5-10%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">10-20%</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5-10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采样策略体系\">采样策略体系</h2><p>采样是最直接的降本手段——在保持统计有效性的前提下，只保留部分日志。关键原则：<strong>采样是数据量的折衷，不是信息量的折衷</strong>——好的采样策略能以 10% 的数据量保留 95% 的排障信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"采样层级\">采样层级</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    HEAD[Head-based Sampling - 入口决策] --&gt; WRITE[写入存储]&#10;    TAIL[Tail-based Sampling - 出口决策] --&gt; WRITE&#10;    DYNAMIC[Dynamic Sampling - 实时调整] --&gt; WRITE&#10;&#10;    HEAD -.-&gt;|优势| H1[延迟低、实现简单]&#10;    HEAD -.-&gt;|劣势| H2[无法保留所有 ERROR]&#10;    TAIL -.-&gt;|优势| T1[保证保留异常请求]&#10;    TAIL -.-&gt;|劣势| T2[需缓冲完整请求周期]&#10;    DYNAMIC -.-&gt;|优势| D1[适应流量变化]&#10;    DYNAMIC -.-&gt;|劣势| D2[实现复杂]\">flowchart TD\n    HEAD[Head-based Sampling - 入口决策] --&gt; WRITE[写入存储]\n    TAIL[Tail-based Sampling - 出口决策] --&gt; WRITE\n    DYNAMIC[Dynamic Sampling - 实时调整] --&gt; WRITE\n\n    HEAD -.-&gt;|优势| H1[延迟低、实现简单]\n    HEAD -.-&gt;|劣势| H2[无法保留所有 ERROR]\n    TAIL -.-&gt;|优势| T1[保证保留异常请求]\n    TAIL -.-&gt;|劣势| T2[需缓冲完整请求周期]\n    DYNAMIC -.-&gt;|优势| D1[适应流量变化]\n    DYNAMIC -.-&gt;|劣势| D2[实现复杂]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>决策时机</th>\n<th>采样依据</th>\n<th>保障</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Head-based</td>\n<td>请求入口（写入前）</td>\n<td>概率/规则</td>\n<td>统计代表性</td>\n<td>高吞吐低价值日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail-based</td>\n<td>请求完成（写入后判定）</td>\n<td>请求结果/延迟/错误</td>\n<td>保留所有异常</td>\n<td>Trace-correlated 日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Priority-based</td>\n<td>写入时</td>\n<td>日志级别/来源</td>\n<td>高优先级 100%</td>\n<td>混合环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dynamic</td>\n<td>运行时持续调整</td>\n<td>当前量/预算/错误率</td>\n<td>成本可控</td>\n<td>流量波动大的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"head-based-sampling-实现\">Head-based Sampling 实现</h3><p>在 OTel Collector 中通过 <code>probabilistic_sampler</code> processor 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  probabilistic_sampler:&#10;    sampling_percentage: 10 # 保留 10% 的日志&#10;    hash_seed: 42&#10;    attribute_source: traceID # 基于 traceID hash，确保同一请求的所有日志保持一致\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  probabilistic_sampler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保留 10% 的日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hash_seed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    attribute_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">traceID</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 基于 traceID hash，确保同一请求的所有日志保持一致</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基于 traceID 的采样保证：一个请求如果被采样，那么该请求的所有日志（跨服务）都会被保留——不会出现&quot;只有一半日志&quot;的断裂情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tail-based-sampling-保留所有异常\">Tail-based Sampling：保留所有异常</h3><p>核心思想：先缓冲一段时间的日志，等请求完成后再决定是否保留。如果请求正常完成——按概率采样；如果请求失败/超时——100% 保留。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    decision_wait: 30s&#10;    policies:&#10;      - name: errors-always&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      - name: slow-requests&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 5000 }&#10;      - name: probabilistic-rest&#10;        type: probabilistic&#10;        probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 5 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    decision_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">errors-always</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">status_codes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slow-requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">threshold_ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic-rest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>决策逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Keep</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>ERROR</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>Bernoulli</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Keep}(request) = \\begin{cases}\n1 &amp; \\text{if } status = \\text{ERROR} \\\\\n1 &amp; \\text{if } latency &gt; threshold \\\\\n\\text{Bernoulli}(p) &amp; \\text{otherwise}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Keep</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bernoulli</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ERROR</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"非采样的成本优化手段\">非采样的成本优化手段</h2><p>采样不是唯一的武器。以下方法可以在不丢弃任何日志的前提下降低成本：</p>\n<h3 id=\"压缩优化\">压缩优化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码/压缩方式</th>\n<th align=\"center\">典型压缩比</th>\n<th align=\"center\">解压速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无压缩</td>\n<td align=\"center\">1:1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td>开发环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LZ4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3-5:1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">极快</td>\n<td>热数据（需快速查询）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZSTD</td>\n<td align=\"center\">5-10:1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">快</td>\n<td>温数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZSTD Level 19</td>\n<td align=\"center\">10-15:1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中</td>\n<td>冷数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delta + ZSTD（列式）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">15-25:1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">快</td>\n<td>ClickHouse 列式存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ClickHouse 的列式存储天然适合日志压缩——<code>timestamp</code> 列是单调递增的时间序列，delta 编码后几乎为零成本；<code>service_name</code> 等低基数列用字典编码压缩到接近 0；只有 <code>body</code> 等自由文本列的压缩率较低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"字段裁剪\">字段裁剪</h3><p>在管道层删除确定不需要的字段，减少存储量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  transform:&#10;    log_statements:&#10;      - context: log&#10;        statements:&#10;          # 删除 DEBUG 日志中的大 payload（保留消息但裁剪详情）&#10;          - delete_key(attributes, &quot;http.request.body&quot;) where severity_number &lt;= 8&#10;          - delete_key(attributes, &quot;http.response.body&quot;) where severity_number &lt;= 12&#10;          # 截断过长的 body&#10;          - truncate_all(attributes, 4096)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    log_statements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        statements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 删除 DEBUG 日志中的大 payload（保留消息但裁剪详情）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delete_key(attributes, \"http.request.body\") where severity_number &#x3C;= 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delete_key(attributes, \"http.response.body\") where severity_number &#x3C;= 12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 截断过长的 body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">truncate_all(attributes, 4096)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"聚合替代明细\">聚合替代明细</h3><p>对于高频重复日志（如 health check 日志），用聚合替代逐条记录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 每分钟将重复日志聚合为一条计数&#10;processors:&#10;  groupbyattrs:&#10;    keys: [service_name, level, body_template]&#10;  metricstransform:&#10;    transforms:&#10;      - include: log_record_count&#10;        action: insert\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每分钟将重复日志聚合为一条计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  groupbyattrs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">body_template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metricstransform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    transforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">log_record_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">insert</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样，1000 条相同的 <code>health check passed</code> 日志变成一条 <code>health check passed (count=1000)</code>——信息无损但体积缩减 99.9%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本治理框架\">成本治理框架</h2><h3 id=\"可见性-知道钱花在哪\">可见性：知道钱花在哪</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ClickHouse: 按 service 统计存储成本贡献&#10;SELECT&#10;    service_name,&#10;    sum(length(body) + length(toString(attributes))) AS raw_bytes,&#10;    count() AS log_count,&#10;    raw_bytes / 1024 / 1024 / 1024 AS raw_gb&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE timestamp &gt; now() - INTERVAL 1 DAY&#10;GROUP BY service_name&#10;ORDER BY raw_bytes DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ClickHouse: 按 service 统计存储成本贡献</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(body) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toString(attributes))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw_bytes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    raw_bytes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw_gb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> service_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw_bytes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"问责-让产生日志的团队为成本负责\">问责：让产生日志的团队为成本负责</h3><p>建立 cost attribution 机制——每个团队可以看到自己服务产生的日志量和相应的存储成本。当一个服务的日志量突然翻倍时，对应团队应收到通知并被要求解释/修复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预算与限流\">预算与限流</h3><p>设置 per-tenant/per-service 的日志量上限，超出时触发降级策略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>如果 </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext>自动切换到 head-based sampling</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{如果 } V_{service} &gt; V_{quota}: \\text{自动切换到 head-based sampling} (p = \\frac{V_{quota}}{V_{service}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">如果</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动切换到</span><span class=\"mord\"> head-based sampling</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这确保即使某个服务出现日志风暴（如进入死循环疯狂打日志），也不会把整个日志系统的预算打爆。</p>\n<p>成本优化与采样策略需要与<a href=\"retention-lifecycle\">留存与生命周期管理</a>配合使用——采样减少写入量，分层存储降低保留成本，两者共同构成日志系统的成本控制体系。同时，采样决策必须尊重<a href=\"compliance-audit-trail\">合规与审计追踪</a>的硬约束——审计日志永远不可被采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>成本优化是系统性工程而非简单的&quot;丢数据&quot;。Tail-based sampling 是最优的采样策略——以 5-10% 的数据量保留所有异常请求的完整日志。非采样手段（列式压缩、字段裁剪、聚合替代明细）可以在不丢弃任何信息的前提下降低 50-90% 的存储成本。治理层面：per-service 成本归因让产生日志的团队为成本负责，per-tenant quota 防止日志风暴。审计日志是不可碰触的红线——永远不采样。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本优化与采样策略","id":"成本优化与采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"日志系统成本模型","id":"日志系统成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略体系","id":"采样策略体系"},{"level":3,"text":"采样层级","id":"采样层级"},{"level":3,"text":"Head-based Sampling 实现","id":"head-based-sampling-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Tail-based Sampling：保留所有异常","id":"tail-based-sampling-保留所有异常"},{"level":2,"text":"非采样的成本优化手段","id":"非采样的成本优化手段"},{"level":3,"text":"压缩优化","id":"压缩优化"},{"level":3,"text":"字段裁剪","id":"字段裁剪"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合替代明细","id":"聚合替代明细"},{"level":2,"text":"成本治理框架","id":"成本治理框架"},{"level":3,"text":"可见性：知道钱花在哪","id":"可见性-知道钱花在哪"},{"level":3,"text":"问责：让产生日志的团队为成本负责","id":"问责-让产生日志的团队为成本负责"},{"level":3,"text":"预算与限流","id":"预算与限流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合规与审计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/compliance-audit-trail"},"next":null}